pkg:Evidence_v1_16_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.16.0 (STORY-4 closed -- Cross.A/C verified against the real shipped page)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR: with a real Path B artifact now shipped (STORY-3), ran the verification STORY-4 was rescoped for two turns ago. Extracted CATEGORIES + PRINCIPLES directly from the real shipped file (not the corpus contract source) using the same bracket-matching scanner the real instantiation tooling uses: 7 + 18 = 25 nodes, exactly matching Stage 2's real class count, re-queried fresh. Extracted Stage 1's real skos:Concept inventory (14 concepts, independently confirming Stage1.C's own >=10 requirement) and checked each against the shipped page's actual principle text: 14 of 14 covered = 1.00, well above Cross.C's 0.80 threshold. Confirms precisely what the earlier domain-engineering finding predicted: Cross.A's literal wording does not apply to this pattern, but its real intent (full traceable concept coverage) holds, verified against the real artifact rather than assumed from its source data. Closed with real Evidence and an observable-behaviour AcceptanceCriterion. Re-verified: pipeline order unaffected, full SHACL 0 violations."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "fc1e6b0c97341a698417b6a2f133b841cb4f9d6af3f911f67983500df18a3a43"^^xsd:string .
